				<pubDate>Sun, 15 Jun 2014 06:24:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>thedeadlymoose</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>732274</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I don't recall reading this for the Time Contest. WTF.</p> <p>Anyway, opening is great.</p> <p>The opening <em>scene</em> needs more misdirection. Too much exposition, not enough actually happening.</p> <p>Rest is pretty good. Cool. +1</p> <p>EDIT: Just a heads up, though, this would be very, very difficult to understand without first reading <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mud-on-the-carpet">Mud On The Carpet</a>, so it's odd that more effort isn't put into explaining the setting within the story.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
