					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-689640#post-1843471</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-689640/those-thin-penultimate-hours#post-1843471</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 01 Sep 2013 01:21:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Azradun</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1416455</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So there *was* some scientific data regained from SCP-173.</p> <p>I like the seamless way all those SCP objects were integrated into the story. Nothing felt forced or out of place there, everything was used in a natural and plausible way. Reminds me of the single sci-fi element from &quot;Prestige&quot; and the mastery with which it was interwoven into the plot. Sweet.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
